I had a similar problem when first playing patch level 10.  A freind gave
me a file he obtained from somewhere (it may have been when he downloaded
the new version).  It contained discussion regarding the overlay managers
as well as some recommended procedures for startup.  Others of this group 
may be able to tell you the name of the file.  Basically it recommended
having a seperate boot disk with nothing on it but the bare minimum, path 
to nethack directory ansi.sys in config.sys file and thats about it.  None of 
the other drivers you mentioned in your articl.  I followed the instructions
and it took care of all my problems.  Hope this helps.

